[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Your business can claim back taxes on any parcels you send across the UK with us - that makes your parcels even cheaper!<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----></div></div></section><section id="more-ways-of-sending" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral conditional-section-wrapper" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="default-slice" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->More ways of sending<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h2><!--]--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Don’t need to send parcels in bulk or from a marketplace? No problem.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container--2cols article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJGJbqstJ9-Tfq_EVRI_LOCATION_03_273052b8.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJGJbqstJ9-Tfq_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2730.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJGJbqstJ9-Tfq_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2730.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJGJbqstJ9-Tfq_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2730.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="ParcelShop store assistant is smiling at the customer and handing a blue receipt to confirm that their parcel has been accepted." width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Send<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You can book your parcel online with us and choose from our range of services to suit your needs.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Send a parcel-open Send a parcel page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/send" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Send a parcel<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R3wJbqstJ9-SQ7_EVRI_LOCATION_05_85088a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R3wJbqstJ9-SQ7_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8508.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R3wJbqstJ9-SQ7_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8508.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R3wJbqstJ9-SQ7_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8508.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer sat at a desk in their office using a laptop with multiple parcels packaged next to them. Their hand is positioned against their head to show concentration." width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Quick send<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you send a birthday present once a year to the same recipient or the same products to different customers, our quick send tool can have your parcels ready to post in just a few clicks.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Use quick send-open Use quick send page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/customer/quick-send" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Use quick send<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="an-account-to-suit-you" class="section-wrapper feature-link-cards-promo" index="13" data-v-36172517 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><h2 class="feature-link-cards-promo__title" data-v-36172517>An account to suit you</h2><p class="feature-link-cards-promo__description" data-v-36172517>Looking for an affordable, reliable way to send parcels across the UK and internationally? We have everything you need.</p><div class="feature-link-cards-promo__cards" data-v-36172517><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper promo-card feature-link-cards-promo__c