"height":147},1000,667,"Business owner sat at a desk in their home office taking a phone call and using their laptop to book multiple parcels","bulk-send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R3c5bqstJ9-SQr_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8406.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6R3c5bqstJ9-SQr",{"x":71,"y":71,"zoom":72,"background":73},[153,156],{"type":33,"text":154,"spans":155,"direction":36},"Managing lots of parcels? Whether you’re a hobbyist or crafter, marketplace trader or business owner, our bulk send tool simplifies your shipping and saves you time on admin.",[],{"type":33,"text":157,"spans":158,"direction":36},"Link your accounts to automatically import orders and manage all your deliveries in one place. Once connected, we’ll mark orders as ‘dispatched’ and update tracking information for your customers. You can also upload orders using a CSV file.",[],{"link_type":160},"Any",{"link_type":160},"landing_feature_banner2$72c488bb-bbe2-4406-935d-fd28b268a9cc","landing_feature_banner2",{"variation":165,"version":25,"items":166,"primary":216,"id":219,"slice_type":220,"slice_label":43},"listComponent",[167,174,181,188,195,202,209],{"title":168,"content":169,"icon":173},"Your marketplaces, one simple dashboard",[170],{"type":33,"text":171,"spans":172,"direction":36},"Manage orders from multiple marketplaces and e-commerce platforms in one place",[],"laptops",{"title":175,"content":176,"icon":180},"Spend less time on admin",[177],{"type":33,"text":178,"spans":179,"direction":36},"Automatically import orders, save your shipping preferences, and dispatch parcels faster with fewer manual steps",[],"on_time",{"title":182,"content":183,"icon":187},"Send UK & international parcels",[184],{"type":33,"text":185,"spans":186,"direction":36},"Book, manage and track UK and international deliveries from the same dashboard with ease",[],"above_and_beyond",{"title":189,"content":190,"icon":194},"Set your shipping preferences once",[191],{"type":33,"text":192,"spans":193,"direction":36},"Save parcel sizes, weights, cover and more to speed up every booking",[],"parcel4",{"title":196,"content":197,"icon":201},"Automated updates for your customers",[198],{"type":33,"text":199,"spans":200,"direction":36},"Tracking updates and dispatch confirmations are sent automatically, helping keep customers informed without extra work",[],"phone_2",{"title":203,"content":204,"icon":208},"Built for growing marketplace sellers",[205],{"type":33,"text":206,"spans":207,"direction":36},"Scale your business and manage more orders without increasing your admin",[],"bar_chart",{"title":210,"content":211,"icon":215},"Free to use",[212],{"type":33,"text":213,"spans":214,"direction":36},"No contracts or set-up costs. Simply create an Evri account for free and start sending",[],"money",{"theme":217,"title":218,"description":43},"white","Why use bulk send?","list_blockv2$076d00a3-fc02-4b18-9344-8cbdffdaa665","list_blockv2",{"variation":222,"version":25,"items":223,"primary":268,"id":276,"slice_type":277,"slice_label":43},"3ColumnWithoutLinks",[224,240,254],{"Title":225,"Description":230,"Image":234,"Label":43},[226],{"type":227,"text":228,"spans":229,"direction":36},"heading3","Step 1",[],[231],{"type":33,"text":232,"spans":233,"direction":36},"Log in to your Evri account and go to your bulk send dashboard.",[],{"dimensions":235,"alt":43,"copyright":43,"url":236,"id":237,"edit":238},{"width":146,"height":147},"bulk-send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fahf7CrK9tuLqENfw_Bulksendlaptopstepbystep1-1-.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C103%2C5484%2C3658&w=1000&h=667","ahf7CrK9tuLqENfw",{"x":71,"y":239,"zoom":72,"background":73},103,{"Title":241,"Description":245,"Image":249,"Label":43},[242],{"type":227,"text":243,"spans":244,"direction":36},"Step 2",[],[246],{"type":33,"text":247,"spans":248,"direction":36},"Choose the store to link and follow the step-by-step instructions. They’re a little different for each marketplace.",[],{"dimensions":250,"alt":43,"copyright":43,"url":251,"id":252,"edit":253},{"width":146,"height":147},"bulk-send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fahf7CLK9tuLqENfv_Bulksendlaptopstepbystep2.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C103%2C5484%2C3658&w=1000&h=667","ahf7CLK9tuLqENfv",{"x":71,"y":239,"zoom":72,"background":73},{"Title":255,"Description":259,"Image":263,"Label":43},[256],{"type":227,"text":257,"spans":258,"direction":36},"Step 3",[],[260],{"type":33,"text":261,"spans":262,"direction":36},"Set your shipping preferences. You'll need to do this for UK parcels before you can set international parcel defaults.",[],{"dimensions":264,"alt":43,"copyright":43,"url":265,"id":266,"edit":267},{"width":146,"height":147},"bulk-send.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fahf7BbK9tuLqENfu_Bulksendlaptopstepbystep3.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C103%2C5484%2C3658&w=1000&h=667","ahf7BbK9tuLqENfu",{"x":71,"y":239,"zoom":72,"background":73},{"SectionTitle":269,"SectionDescription":274,"theme":275},[270],{"type":271,"text":272,"spans":273,"direction":36},"heading2","How to link your accounts",[],[],"neutral","article_link_module$44bc723f-f443-4759-8400-7685c13002da","article_link_module",{"variation":279,"version":25,"items":280,"primary":370,"id":376,"slice_type":377,"slice_label":43},"fullList",[281,290,298,302,306,310,318,325,333,341,345,353,362,366],{"integrationLogo":282,"integrationDescription":43},{"dimensions":283,"alt":285,"copyright":43,"url":286,"id":287,"edit":288},{"width":104,"height":284},59,"amazon logo","bulk-send.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0d3404f1-1148-4031-9a71-21edd00d425e_amazon.svg","YiZguBIAACwAGJi1",{"x":71,"y":71,"zoom":72,"background":289},"#fff",{"integrationLogo":291,"integrationDescription":43},{"dimensions":292,"alt":294,"copyright":43,"url":295,"id":296,"edit":297},{"width":293,"height":78},107,"bigcommerce logo","bulk-send.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F